{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Service Discovery/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"02980405-73f4-5e3a-8c0f-28c830111350","excerpt":"✅ 서비스 인스턴스를 자동으로 등록하고 검색 가능 ✅ IP 주소가 동적으로 변경되어도 항상 최신 정보를 제공 \nNetflix Eureka는 Netflix OSS(Open Source Software)에서 제공하는 Service Discovery(서비스 디스커버리) 서버 및 클라이언트 라이브러리 마이크로서비스 환경에서 동적으로 서비스 인스턴스를 등록하고 검…","html":"<p>✅ <strong>서비스 인스턴스를 자동으로 등록하고 검색 가능</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>IP 주소가 동적으로 변경되어도 항상 최신 정보를 제공</strong><br>\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/79f3a/service-discovery-server.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 55.294117647058826%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='service discovery server' title='' src='/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/ca1dc/service-discovery-server.png' srcset='/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/e7570/service-discovery-server.png 170w,\n/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/f46e7/service-discovery-server.png 340w,\n/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/ca1dc/service-discovery-server.png 680w,\n/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/02d09/service-discovery-server.png 1020w,\n/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/9d567/service-discovery-server.png 1360w,\n/static/093e10fe58e2ea2e471311615ed618f1/79f3a/service-discovery-server.png 1622w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n<strong>Netflix Eureka</strong>는 Netflix OSS(Open Source Software)에서 제공하는 <strong>Service Discovery(서비스 디스커버리) 서버 및 클라이언트 라이브러리</strong><br>\n마이크로서비스 환경에서 <strong>동적으로 서비스 인스턴스를 등록하고 검색</strong>할 수 있도록 도움</p>\n<h3 id=\"-Netflix-Eureka-구성-요소\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Netflix-Eureka-%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C\" aria-label=\" Netflix Eureka 구성 요소 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Netflix Eureka 구성 요소</strong></h3>\n<p>Eureka는 <strong>클라이언트/서버 아키텍처</strong>로 구성되며, <code class=\"language-text\">Eureka Server</code>와 <code class=\"language-text\">Eureka Client</code>로 구분</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>구성 요소</th>\n<th>역할</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Eureka Server</strong></td>\n<td>서비스 등록 및 검색을 관리하는 중앙 서버</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Eureka Client</strong></td>\n<td>Eureka Server에 서비스 등록 및 조회하는 클라이언트</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>✅ <strong>Eureka Server는 독립적인 서비스로 실행되며, Eureka Client가 이를 사용하여 서비스를 등록하고 조회</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"Eureka-Server\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Eureka-Server\" aria-label=\"Eureka Server permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Eureka Server</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ Netflix에서 제공하는 <strong>Servcie Discovery Server 라이브러리</strong><br>\n✅ MSA에서 <strong>서비스 등록 및 검색 기능</strong> 제공</p>\n<h3 id=\"-Netflix-Eureka-Server의-역할\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Netflix-Eureka-Server%EC%9D%98-%EC%97%AD%ED%95%A0\" aria-label=\" Netflix Eureka Server의 역할 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Netflix Eureka Server의 역할</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>서비스 등록</strong>: 마이크로서비스가 실행되면서 Eureka Server에 자신을 등록<br>\n✅ <strong>서비스 검색</strong>: 마이크로서비스가 Eureka Server에서 <strong>다른 서비스의 위치(IP, 포트)를 조회</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>헬스 체크</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>서비스가 정상적으로 실행되고 있는지 주기적으로 상태를 체크(heartbeat)</li>\n<li>일정 시간 응답이 없으면 자동으로 해당 서비스 제거</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"-Netflix-Eureka-Server-설정-및-실행\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Netflix-Eureka-Server-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89\" aria-label=\" Netflix Eureka Server 설정 및 실행 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Netflix Eureka Server 설정 및 실행</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>build.gradle</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"gradle\"><pre class=\"language-gradle\"><code class=\"language-gradle\"><span class=\"token keyword\">implementation</span> <span class=\"token string\">'org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-starter-netflix-eureka-server'</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>✅ \b.java</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@SpringBootApplication</span>  \n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@EnableEurekaServer</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DiscoveryserviceApplication</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token class-name\">SpringApplication</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">DiscoveryserviceApplication</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>@EnableEurekaServer</strong>: 해당 서버를 discovery service로 지정</p>\n<p><strong>✅ 설정 파일</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"yaml\"><pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">server</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">port</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">8761</span>  \n<span class=\"token key atrule\">spring</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">application</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> discoveryservice  \n<span class=\"token key atrule\">eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">client</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">register-with-eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">false</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">fetch-registry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">false</span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>application.name</strong>: 해당 애플리케이션 서버의 이름(고유한 id)</li>\n<li><strong>register-with-eureka</strong>: discovery service에 client로 등록할 것인지에 대한 설정값</li>\n<li><strong>fetch-registry</strong>: 다른 서비스의 정보를 가져오는지 여부</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>✅ 서버 실행</strong>\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/9ad8b/1.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 42.35294117647059%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='1' title='' src='/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/ca1dc/1.png' srcset='/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/e7570/1.png 170w,\n/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/f46e7/1.png 340w,\n/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/ca1dc/1.png 680w,\n/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/02d09/1.png 1020w,\n/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/9d567/1.png 1360w,\n/static/15fafae5bcfbde70e24a0ca8b3784787/9ad8b/1.png 2940w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eureka Server에서 제공하는 <strong>대시보드</strong> 조회 가능</li>\n<li><strong>어떤 인스턴스가 등록되었는지 확인</strong> 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"Netflix-Eureka-Client\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Netflix-Eureka-Client\" aria-label=\"Netflix Eureka Client permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Netflix Eureka Client</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ Eureka Server에 자신을 등록하고, 다른 서비스의 위치를 조회 가능</p>\n<h3 id=\"-Netflix-Eureka-Client-설정-및-실행\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Netflix-Eureka-Client-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89\" aria-label=\" Netflix Eureka Client 설정 및 실행 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Netflix Eureka Client 설정 및 실행</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>build.gradle</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">implementation 'org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-web'  \nimplementation 'org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-starter-netflix-eureka-client'</code></pre></div>\n<p>✅ <strong>설정 파일</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"yml\"><pre class=\"language-yml\"><code class=\"language-yml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">server</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">port</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">9001</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">spring</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">application</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>service\n  \n<span class=\"token key atrule\">eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">client</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">fetch-registry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">register-with-eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">service-url</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n      <span class=\"token key atrule\">defaultZone</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> http<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//localhost<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>8761/eureka</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>application.name</strong>: 해당 애플리케이션 서버의 이름(고유한 id)</li>\n<li><strong>register-with-eureka</strong>: discovery service에 client로 등록</li>\n<li><strong>fetch-registry</strong>: 다른 서비스의 정보를 가져올 것</li>\n</ul>\n<p>✅ <strong>서버 실행</strong>\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/caa30/2.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 42.35294117647059%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='2' title='' src='/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/ca1dc/2.png' srcset='/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/e7570/2.png 170w,\n/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/f46e7/2.png 340w,\n/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/ca1dc/2.png 680w,\n/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/02d09/2.png 1020w,\n/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/9d567/2.png 1360w,\n/static/defb750a77ee7fe4a927fa382213c97a/caa30/2.png 2938w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>인스턴스가 정상적으로 등록</li>\n<li>현재는 <strong>port가 명시적으로 지정</strong>되어 있기 때문에 <strong>Scale Out 시 여러 User Service 인스턴스를 등록할 수 없다.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"-Random-Port-설정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Random-Port-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\" Random Port 설정 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Random Port 설정</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 설정 파일</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"yaml\"><pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">server</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">port</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>  \n<span class=\"token key atrule\">spring</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">application</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>service  \n  \n<span class=\"token key atrule\">eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">instance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">instance-id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> $<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>spring.application.name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>$<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>spring.application.instance_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>$<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>random.value<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">client</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">fetch-registry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">register-with-eureka</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>  \n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">service-url</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  \n      <span class=\"token key atrule\">defaultZone</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> http<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//localhost<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>8761/eureka</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>server.port : 0</strong>: <strong>사용 가능한 포트를 자동 할당</strong></li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>instance-id</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Eureka는 기본적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">host ip : service name : port</code>를 기준으로 서비스 인스턴스를 등록</strong></li>\n<li>동일한 <strong>User Service를 여러 개 실행하면 위 값이 동일하여 문제 발생 가능</strong></li>\n<li>이를 해결하기 위해 <code class=\"language-text\">instance-id</code>를 고유한 값으로 설정하여 <strong>각 인스턴스를 개별적으로 인식</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>✅ 서버 실행</strong>\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/9ad8b/3.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 41.76470588235294%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='3' title='' src='/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/ca1dc/3.png' srcset='/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/e7570/3.png 170w,\n/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/f46e7/3.png 340w,\n/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/ca1dc/3.png 680w,\n/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/02d09/3.png 1020w,\n/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/9d567/3.png 1360w,\n/static/aa3ec5da30d753116302cdd5c751450c/9ad8b/3.png 2940w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>두 user-service 인스턴스가 정상적으로 등록</strong></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Service Discovery","date":"February 18, 2025","update":"February 18, 2025","tags":["MSA"],"series":"MSA 기본 개념 정리"},"fields":{"slug":"/Service Discovery/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.39}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"8afcaf03-808d-5f75-842e-6d3bb841db45","fields":{"slug":"/MSA 개요/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"MSA 개요"}}},{"node":{"id":"02980405-73f4-5e3a-8c0f-28c830111350","fields":{"slug":"/Service Discovery/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Service Discovery"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/상위 계층/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"상위 계층"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"02980405-73f4-5e3a-8c0f-28c830111350","series":"MSA 기본 개념 정리","previousPostId":"602c5a07-56fc-5c04-88cf-53641bb290af","nextPostId":null}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}